    <!--Almond Croissants-->
    <div class="dessert-card">
    <h2> Almond Croissants</h2>
    <h4>A delicate pastry filled with the sweet nutty goodness of almond paste, dusted with powered sugar, and baked to a golden perfection</h4>
    <img src="AlmondCroissants.png" alt="Image description" />
    <!-- Almond Croissants - chatGPT - CCO 1.0 -->
    <h3> Ingredients </h3>
    
      <li>1 sheet of puff pastry</li>    
      <li>1/2 cup of almond paste</li>
      <li>1/4 cup of powdered sugar</li>
      <li> 1 egg (for egg wash)</li>
              
    <h3> Instructions </h3>
   
    <ol>
      <img src="AlmondCroissant3.png" alt="Image description" />
      <!-- Almond Croissants - chatGPT - CCO 1.0 -->
      <li>First pre-heat the oven to 375 degrees F<br>
      <li>Next, roll out the puff pastry and cut it into triangles</li><br>
      
      <li>Spread a thin layer of almond paste on each triangle</li><br>
            <li>Then, roll each triangle from the base to the tip, and curve in a cresent shape</li><br>
              <li> Finally, brush with egg wash and sprinkle with powerdered sugar, and bake for 15-20 minutes until it's golden brown</li><br>
      
    </ol>
